WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.033
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.033 --> 00:00:04.067
You're here.
You made it.

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:06.901
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:09.400
Well, guys,
today some historic news --

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:13.000
President Biden announced that
Judge Ketanji Brown Jackson

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.767
is his nominee
for the Supreme Court.

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:17.767
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:19.601 --> 00:00:23.367
Yeah, Judge Jackson actually
has supporters in both parties.

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:24.634
[ Cheering and applause ]
Yeah, the announcement was good.

00:00:24.634 --> 00:00:26.234
It was good for Biden's
approval ratings,

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:27.968
so he's going to nominate
her again on Monday.

00:00:27.968 --> 00:00:29.934
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Oh.

00:00:29.934 --> 00:00:31.367
-During his speech, Biden said,

00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:34.334
"For too long...our courts,
haven't looked like America,"

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:36.601
which means his next nominee
will be a guy in a trucker hat

00:00:36.601 --> 00:00:37.868
chugging a Hard Mountain Dew.

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:39.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:39.467 --> 00:00:41.701
But this is interesting --
Judge Jackson actually clerked

00:00:41.701 --> 00:00:43.234
for Justice Breyer,

00:00:43.234 --> 00:00:45.467
whose seat she's nominated
to fill.

00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:47.200
[ Audience ohs ]

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.267
Biden was like, "I can relate.

00:00:48.267 --> 00:00:49.467
I interned for FDR."

00:00:49.467 --> 00:00:53.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:53.501 --> 00:00:55.701
Meanwhile, all eyes are still
on the Ukraine.

00:00:55.701 --> 00:00:58.000
Today Pope Francis went
in person

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.467
to the Russian Embassy in Rome
to criticize the invasion.

00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:03.000
You could tell the pope was mad
because there was

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.734
white smoke billowing
from his ears.

00:01:04.734 --> 00:01:06.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.567 --> 00:01:08.567
Well, listen to this --
I heard that Russian oligarchs

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:10.434
are trying to get
around sanctions

00:01:10.434 --> 00:01:12.834
by purchasing cryptocurrency.

00:01:12.834 --> 00:01:13.968
That's right, the oligarchs

00:01:13.968 --> 00:01:15.868
are trying to hide
their money in crypto

00:01:15.868 --> 00:01:17.701
while the rest are frantically
calling Jason Bateman

00:01:17.701 --> 00:01:18.901
and asking how to launder it.

00:01:18.901 --> 00:01:20.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.467 --> 00:01:22.133
Well, this is going viral --
on an episode

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:23.367
of "The Price is Right,"

00:01:23.367 --> 00:01:25.067
someone noticed
that a contestant

00:01:25.067 --> 00:01:27.767
had a little trouble
leaving the stage.

00:01:27.767 --> 00:01:29.701
Follow the woman
in the red shirt.

00:01:29.701 --> 00:01:31.934
-80 and there's the 20.

00:01:31.934 --> 00:01:34.133
[ Beeping ]
Aw. Nice meeting ya, Kari.

00:01:34.133 --> 00:01:35.200
-Thank you.
-Good luck to you.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:37.167
[ Buzzer ]
Darren, come on over here.

00:01:37.167 --> 00:01:39.701
-Go to your right!
-It's Mr. Plinko himself.

00:01:39.701 --> 00:01:41.467
What's going on?
Won $3,000 on Plinko.

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:43.067
Give it a spin.
Good luck to you.

00:01:43.067 --> 00:01:44.067
Need a dollar.

00:01:44.067 --> 00:01:46.033
[ Laughter ]
[ Beep ]

00:01:46.033 --> 00:01:47.501
[ Beeping ]

00:01:47.501 --> 00:01:48.501
You want to say hi?

00:01:48.501 --> 00:01:51.167
-Yes, I can say hi
to Melissa Camino

00:01:51.167 --> 00:01:52.934
and Eric in Hawaii, yeah!

00:01:52.934 --> 00:01:55.601
My family, my mom,
my daughter Kiley.

00:01:55.601 --> 00:01:59.334
-95, which, normally, a winner,

00:01:59.334 --> 00:02:01.167
but you need a nickel right now

00:02:01.167 --> 00:02:03.000
[ Beeping ]
to tie it up.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.400
-Unbelievable.
My gosh.

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:09.000
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.634
A second later,
the announcer was like --

00:02:10.634 --> 00:02:13.934
[ Changes accent ]
Kari Johnson,
come off the stage, dammit!

00:02:13.934 --> 00:02:15.734
[ Laughter ]
[ Rimshot ]

00:02:15.734 --> 00:02:16.767
Eventually, she just gave up

00:02:16.767 --> 00:02:18.400
and she started modeling
the new cars.

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:21.567
[ Laughter ]
♪♪

00:02:21.567 --> 00:02:23.167
Some more TV news --
last night,

00:02:23.167 --> 00:02:26.000
"Law &amp; Order" returned to NBC
after 12 years.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.100
[ Cheering and applause ]
Great.

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.701
And you could tell
they're trying to update it

00:02:31.701 --> 00:02:34.067
for a younger audience.
Check this out.

00:02:34.067 --> 00:02:35.634
-In the criminal justice system,

00:02:35.634 --> 00:02:37.567
sus people are
low-key represented

00:02:37.567 --> 00:02:39.734
[ Laughter ]
by two separate,
yet equally cheugy groups

00:02:39.734 --> 00:02:41.267
that just hit different --

00:02:41.267 --> 00:02:44.267
[ Laughter ]
the feds, who flex
on bad vibes in 4K;

00:02:44.267 --> 00:02:47.467
and the Gucci fam,
who claps back, no cap.

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:49.634
These are their
Instagram Stories.

00:02:49.634 --> 00:02:50.901
[ Laughter ]
Cheese!

00:02:50.901 --> 00:02:51.934
[ Double tone ]

00:02:51.934 --> 00:02:55.167
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:55.167 --> 00:02:56.767
-Cheugy.
-Wow!

00:02:56.767 --> 00:02:57.968
They're really pushing it.

00:02:57.968 --> 00:02:59.434
Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:02:59.434 --> 00:03:01.701
-What the...?
Oh, my God.

00:03:01.701 --> 00:03:03.534
-In other news,
this spring break,

00:03:03.534 --> 00:03:05.934
Miami Beach has decided
to prohibit the sale

00:03:05.934 --> 00:03:08.667
and consumption of alcohol
past 2:00 am.

00:03:08.667 --> 00:03:10.701
[ Audience ohs ]
And this is a big deal
for Miami.

00:03:10.701 --> 00:03:11.901
I mean, this is --

00:03:11.901 --> 00:03:14.167
[ Laughter ]
for --

00:03:14.167 --> 00:03:15.901
[ Applause ]

00:03:15.901 --> 00:03:18.634
For most people, it's --

00:03:18.634 --> 00:03:20.267
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.267 --> 00:03:22.934
Yeah, that's
a party destination.

00:03:22.934 --> 00:03:24.801
I'm sorry.

00:03:24.801 --> 00:03:27.100
Sorry.
Oh, can I help you?

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:29.601
No? Okay.
Can we help you?

00:03:29.601 --> 00:03:31.767
-No.
-No, you're fine. Okay, sure.

00:03:31.767 --> 00:03:32.901
Oh!
[ Laughter ]

00:03:32.901 --> 00:03:35.067
Okay.

00:03:35.067 --> 00:03:37.968
Let's get back
to the monologue here.

00:03:37.968 --> 00:03:38.934
Okay.

00:03:38.934 --> 00:03:42.334
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.334 --> 00:03:44.033
No, sorry, that is not --

00:03:44.033 --> 00:03:46.734
No, down there is not a stairs,
no, not at all.

00:03:46.734 --> 00:03:48.167
Thank you.
You can go.

00:03:48.167 --> 00:03:49.767
[ Laughter ]
Thank you.

00:03:49.767 --> 00:03:50.601
She'll find her way.

00:03:50.601 --> 00:03:53.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.434 --> 00:03:59.234
[ Laughter ]
Some business news --

00:03:59.234 --> 00:04:01.434
I saw that --

00:04:01.434 --> 00:04:04.000
[ Laughter ]

00:04:07.701 --> 00:04:09.534
That way. You can just go
out that way, please.

00:04:09.534 --> 00:04:11.667
No. No, why would you go
that way?

00:04:11.667 --> 00:04:14.133
That way.
That way.

00:04:14.133 --> 00:04:16.534
Yeah, point there.
Yeah. Thank you.

00:04:16.534 --> 00:04:19.234
Good luck. There she is,
everybody, finally.

00:04:19.234 --> 00:04:21.234
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:04:24.367 --> 00:04:26.667
[ Laughter ]

00:04:26.667 --> 00:04:29.467
The handle, the door handle,
the door handle.

00:04:29.467 --> 00:04:31.767
Push! Push, push, push!
-She's pulling.

00:04:31.767 --> 00:04:33.434
-Push! Push!
-Pulling.

00:04:33.434 --> 00:04:35.334
Push, push the door.

00:04:35.334 --> 00:04:37.601
Someone help her. Someone
push her out of here, please.

00:04:37.601 --> 00:04:41.033
Please get this woman
out of the building, somehow.

00:04:41.033 --> 00:04:43.834
Please get -- Oh my.
Yes, thank you. She's there.

00:04:43.834 --> 00:04:45.834
[ Cheering and applause ]
Oh, God!

00:04:45.834 --> 00:04:48.234
Wow!
Holy mackerel.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:50.868
What?

00:04:53.067 --> 00:04:55.067
-That's so cheugy.
-My God! Oh.

00:04:55.067 --> 00:04:56.667
[ Laughter ]
Some business news --

00:04:56.667 --> 00:04:58.834
I saw that Honda
is investigating claims

00:04:58.834 --> 00:05:03.567
of unexpected braking in nearly
two million of its vehicles.

00:05:03.567 --> 00:05:05.367
When they heard, Kia was like,

00:05:05.367 --> 00:05:08.267
"And that's why our cars
don't have brakes."

00:05:08.267 --> 00:05:11.534
[ Laughter ]

00:05:11.534 --> 00:05:13.300
Basically, every Honda looks
like a kid

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:14.434
taking a driver's test.

00:05:14.434 --> 00:05:18.033
[ Laughter ]

00:05:18.033 --> 00:05:19.234
Is she still -- Is she okay?

00:05:19.234 --> 00:05:20.767
Does she --
-Oh.

00:05:20.767 --> 00:05:22.534
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, she's not left the hallway.

00:05:22.534 --> 00:05:23.801
She's just there.
Oh, my.

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:27.634
And, finally,
authorities in Pennsylvania

00:05:27.634 --> 00:05:29.634
arrested a man
for drunk driving,

00:05:29.634 --> 00:05:31.834
but it's not your typical case.
Watch this.

00:05:31.834 --> 00:05:35.100
-Police say an Amish man faces
drunk driving charges

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:37.834
after reportedly operating
a horse and buggy

00:05:37.834 --> 00:05:39.200
in a reckless manner.

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:41.133
Police say they started
following the horse and buggy

00:05:41.133 --> 00:05:42.567
and saw it go around a turn

00:05:42.567 --> 00:05:45.133
and speed up
as Byler locked the brakes

00:05:45.133 --> 00:05:48.300
and slid the wheels,
which caused sparks.

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:50.200
[ Laughter ]

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.901
The police tracked him down
after a thrilling

00:05:51.901 --> 00:05:54.367
two-mile-an-hour chase.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:54.367 --> 00:05:56.000
It's tough because he wasn't
the one drinking.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.033
It was the horse.

00:05:57.033 --> 00:05:57.968
[ Applause ]
We have a great show.

